    {
      "contentTypeKey": "458004c2-2f2b-40bf-8fd7-cad968995e49",
      "key": "0b123f1f-5cd1-44a8-9128-1efd70504325",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "c201d9d2-a695-45de-98f2-7f36ae3c326d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursions \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOne free place per 10 paying passengers\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "4945d95b-378d-48b7-965c-e32b85b5c449",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EFour nights on half board basis at the 4* Best Western Plus the Quays Hotel. Located a 15-20 minute walk from Sheffield city centre, facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, indoor swimming pool and a gymnasium and all rooms are en suite.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "37f7dbac-37ad-4c82-9df1-a1b03c8fdaf2",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKedleston Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EArkwright\u0026#39;s Cromford Mill\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHaddon Hall - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBakewell\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EChatsworth House\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ERenishaw Hall \u0026amp; Gardens - guided tour\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHardwick Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E17th century Sudbury Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "de535189-b468-4594-8118-f303bac50e3c",
      "key": "95c50ff9-e507-4896-a04e-33eb5788fa9d",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Tailor your sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETissington Hall - a beautiful Jacobean mansion and the home of eight generations of the FitzHerbert family\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELyme Park - dating from the 16th century and set in 15 acres of formal gardens and a 1300 acre deer park, the architecture is a mixture of Palladian, Baroque and Gothic and the library contains one of the rare Caxton missals\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECrich Tramway Village - overlooking the famous Derwent Valley, this lovingly restored period village is also home to the National Tramway Museum and its world renowned archives\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBolsover Castle - a unique survival of a Stuart \u2018prodigy house\u2019, this fashionable retreat into an imaginary golden age of chivalry was designed solely for pleasure and extravagant display\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHeights of Abraham - the cable car high above Matlock Bath and opposite High Tor affords magnificent views of the Derwent Valley and gives an insight into the lead mining activities of the Peak District\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Here are some more suggested places of interest you might like to include:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "e6d4c45e-864d-4564-b4b3-c432c533cc22",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1 \u2013 Kedleston Hall\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBoard our private executive coach at your preferred pick up points \u2013 stop at a convenient property en route such as Kedleston Hall, built between 1759 and 1765 for the Curzon family who have lived in the area since the 12th century and boasting the most complete and least altered sequence of Robert Adam interiors in England \u2013 continue to the 4* Best Western Plus the Quays Hotel in Sheffield.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2 \u2013 Arkwright\u2019s Cromford Mill \u0026amp; Haddon Hall\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EDesigned by Sir Richard Arkwright and built in 1771, Arkwright\u2019s Cromford Mill was the world\u2019s first successful water powered cotton spinning mill and today is the centrepiece of the World Heritage listed Derwent Valley Mills \u2013 guided tour of Haddon Hall explores a fortified manor house dating from the 12th century and surrounded by terraced Elizabethan gardens.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3 \u2013 Bakewell \u0026amp; Chatsworth House\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EMorning in Bakewell, famous for the production of the \u2018tart\u2019 or Bakewell Pudding as it is known locally \u2013 Chatsworth, one of Britain\u2019s best loved historic houses and estates and the home of the Duke and Duchess of Devonshire, offers famous works of art, spectacular fountains and fine shopping, all set in the magnificent landscape of Derbyshire\u2019s Peak District National Park.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4 \u2013 Renishaw Hall and Gardens \u0026amp; Hardwick Hall\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EGuided tour of Renishaw Hall, home to the Sitwell family for almost 400 years, followed by free time to explore the Italianate gardens \u2013 Hardwick Hall, a 16th century Elizabethan treasure house and a magnificent statement of the wealth and status of its builder, Bess of Hardwick, is almost unchanged since she lived here giving a rare insight into the formality of Elizabethan courtly life.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5 \u2013 Baddesley Clinton\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EStop at a convenient property en route home such as Baddesley Clinton in Warwickshire, home of the Ferrers family for 500 years and a sanctuary not only for the family, but also for persecuted Catholics who were hidden from priest hunters in its secret hiding places during the 1590s \u2013 return to our original departure points with comfort stops en route.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Suggested Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Every one of our tours is exclusively for your group and your group alone so each one can be tailor made to suit the interests and profile of your members until you have a tour with an itinerary and at a price which matches the interests and profile of your members."
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "Remember this itinerary is just our suggestion. "
          }
        }
      ]
    },
